```

> **💡 Finding latest versions**: Search [Maven Central](https://central.sonatype.com/) for `durabletask-azure-functions` (group: `com.microsoft`) to find the current stable version.

### host.json

```json
{
  "version": "2.0",
  "extensions": {
    "durableTask": {
      "hubName": "default",
      "storageProvider": {
        "type": "durabletask-scheduler",
