#### .NET

```csharp
var client = new ServiceBusClient(
    Environment.GetEnvironmentVariable("SERVICEBUS_CONNECTION_STRING")
);
var sender = client.CreateSender("orders");

await sender.SendMessageAsync(new ServiceBusMessage("{\"orderId\": \"123\"}"));
